<div class="site-container article-page">
  <a class="text-link article-back" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>"><%- site_icon('arrow-left') %> 文章归档</a>
  <header class="article-heading"><div class="story-meta"><span><%= category_name(page) %></span><time datetime="<%= date(page.date,'YYYY-MM-DD') %>"><%= date(page.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time><span><%= article_minutes(page) %> 分钟阅读</span></div><h1><%= clean_title(page.title) %></h1><p><%= article_summary(page) %></p><div class="article-byline"><img src="<%- url_for('/img/avatar.jpg') %>" alt="Yangting SONG" width="32" height="32"><span>Yangting SONG</span><span class="byline-update">更新 <%= date(page.updated || page.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></span><button class="icon-button" type="button" id="copy-article" title="复制文章链接" aria-label="复制文章链接"><%- site_icon('link') %></button><span id="copy-status" role="status"></span></div></header>
  <% if (page.cover) { %><figure class="article-cover"><img src="<%- url_for(page.cover) %>" alt="<%= clean_title(page.title) %>"></figure><% } %>
  <div class="article-layout"><article id="article-container" class="prose"><%- page.content %></article><aside class="article-toc"><h2>目录 <span>On this page</span></h2><%- toc(page.content, {class:'toc',max_depth:3}) %></aside></div>
  <div class="article-end"><div class="article-tags"><% (page.tags ? page.tags.toArray() : []).forEach(tag=>{ %><a href="<%- url_for(tag.path) %>"><%= tag.name %></a><% }) %></div><p>来源与研究边界以正文和对应项目的当前说明为准。</p></div>
  <nav class="article-neighbors" aria-label="相邻文章"><% if(page.prev){ %><a href="<%- url_for(page.prev.path) %>"><span>上一篇</span><strong><%= clean_title(page.prev.title) %></strong></a><% } %><% if(page.next){ %><a href="<%- url_for(page.next.path) %>"><span>下一篇</span><strong><%= clean_title(page.next.title) %></strong></a><% } %></nav>
</div>
